  "goodToKnow": "Einfordern means to demand or call in something one is owed: Schulden einfordern, Rechte einfordern, Respekt einfordern. It's stronger than fordern in implying a rightful claim. Die Forderung is a demand or a financial claim. Don't confuse fordern with fördern (to support, promote): Fördern und Fordern was the slogan of Germany's 2005 welfare reform. Separable: forderte ein, eingefordert."
